<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">OUR TABLE / REVIEWS</view><view class="title">这顿饭，<text>好吃吗</text></view><block wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}"><view class="notice">登录后评价这顿饭。收到分享的朋友无需日常密令，登录仅用于记录评价身份。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="signIn" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">微信登录，开始评价</button></block><block wx:else><view class="notice" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在获取评价…</view><block wx:if="{{sheet}}"><view class="subtitle">{{sheet.restaurantName}} · {{sheet.date}} · {{mealName}}</view><view class="notice">已评 {{sheet.reviewedCount}} / {{foods.length}} 道 · {{sheet.canSubmit ? '评价至 ' + deadlineText + '（北京时间）' : '评价期已结束，内容仅供回看'}}</view><view class="section" wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="dishId"><view class="row"><text class="subtitle">{{item.dishName}}</text><text>{{item.quantity}} 份</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.specifications}}</view><view class="muted">均分 {{item.averageText}} · {{item.reviewCount}} 条评价</view><block wx:if="{{item.mine}}"><view class="my-review"><image class="avatar" wx:if="{{item.mine.reviewerAvatar}}" src="{{item.mine.reviewerAvatar}}"/>{{item.mine.reviewerName}} · {{item.mine.rating}} 星</view><view class="comment" wx:if="{{item.mine.comment}}">{{item.mine.comment}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{item.mine.canModify}}" data-id="{{item.dishId}}" bindtap="edit" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">修改我的评价（仅一次）</button><view class="muted" wx:else>我的评价已锁定</view></block><button class="secondary" wx:elif="{{sheet.canSubmit}}" data-id="{{item.dishId}}" bindtap="edit" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">评价这道菜</button></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{sheet.canSubmit}}">同菜不同规格共用一次评分。每条评价可在首次提交后24小时内改一次，不超过整单7天期限。</view><button class="primary" wx:if="{{canShare}}" open-type="share">邀请朋友评价</button><view class="notice" wx:if="{{shareError}}">{{shareError}}<text class="link" bindtap="prepareShare">重试准备分享</text></view></block></block><view class="error" wx:if="{{error && !editor}}">{{error}}<text class="link" wx:if="{{retryPending}}" bindtap="retry">重试原操作</text><text class="link" wx:else bindtap="load">重试加载</text></view></view>
<view class="overlay" wx:if="{{editor}}" catchtap="close"><view class="drawer" catchtap="noop"><view class="row"><text class="subtitle">{{editor.dishName}}</text><text class="link" bindtap="close">关闭</text></view><view class="stars"><button wx:for="{{stars}}" wx:key="*this" data-star="{{item}}" bindtap="rate" class="star {{rating >= item ? 'selected' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">{{rating >= item ? '★' : '☆'}}</button></view><view class="muted">{{rating ? rating + ' 星' : '请主动选择评分'}}</view><textarea value="{{comment}}" bindinput="text" maxlength="4096" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}" placeholder="想说的话，选填，最多200字"/><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<text class="link" wx:if="{{retryPending}}" bindtap="retry">重试原操作</text><text class="link" wx:else bindtap="checkLatest">核对最新评价</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存评价</button></view></view>
